<title>UK: Argentina sets 50 billion yen seven-year Eurobond.</title>
<headline>Argentina sets 50 billion yen seven-year Eurobond.</headline>
<dateline>LONDON 1997-04-30</dateline>
<text>
<p>The following bond was announced</p>
<p>by lead manager Yamaichi International (Europe) Ltd.</p>
<p> BORROWER   REPUBLIC OF ARGENTINA</p>
<p> AMT    50 BLN YEN    COUPON     4.40	MATURITY    27.MAY.04</p>
<p> TYPE	 STRAIGHT  ISS PRICE  99.85     PAY DATE    27.MAY.97</p>
<p> FULL FEES  0.9	 REOFFER    99.85     PAY FREQ    SEMI-ANN</p>
<p> MOODY	B1	  LISTING    NONE</p>
<p> S&amp;P	  BB	  DENOMS (M) 10	  SALE LIMITS US/UK/JP</p>
<p> NEG PLG    YES	 CRS DEFLT  YES	 FORCE MAJ   YES</p>
<p> GOV LAW    ENGLISH   HOME CTRY  ARGENTINA TAX PROVS   =</p>
<p> MGT/UND    0.20	SELL CONC  0.70	PRAECIPUUM  =</p>
<p> NOTES	ISSUED OFF THE EMTN PROGRAMME</p>
<p>-- London Newsroom +44 171 542 7658</p>
